{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# VibeCheck — Verified Translation Validation\nPost-hoc formal verification: does LLM-generated Python workflow code conform to its originating BPMN 2.0 specification?","x":-1400,"y":-740,"width":560,"height":130,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"note-independence","type":"text","text":"**Key design decision — dual-track independence**\nModule 01 never sees the generated code; Module 02 never sees the BPMN diagram. The tracks only meet at Module 03 as independently produced mathematical objects. This avoids circular verification (the spec quietly bending to match the code).","x":-700,"y":-740,"width":720,"height":130,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"in-bpmn","type":"text","text":"**INPUT**\nBPMN 2.0 XML\n(business process specification)","x":-1400,"y":-500,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"in-code","type":"text","text":"**INPUT**\nLLM-Generated Python\n(untrusted workflow code)","x":-1400,"y":260,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1","type":"text","text":"**Module 01 · Phase 1**\nSemantic Extraction\nBPMN XML → semantic graph\n(dynamic coverage gate ≥ 1.0 + recovery pass)","x":-1020,"y":-540,"width":340,"height":140},
		{"id":"a2","type":"text","text":"**Module 01 · Phase 2**\nLTLf Synthesis\nP0 safety / P1 liveness / P2 fairness\n+ implicit-else inference (guard resolution ≥ 1.0)","x":-600,"y":-540,"width":340,"height":140},
		{"id":"a3","type":"text","text":"**Module 01 · Phase 3**\nMutation Self-Validation\nmulti-round self-healing (≤3) · kill δ ≥ 1.0 · C_struct ≥ 1.0\n+ adversarial red-team tier (P3, simulated)","x":-180,"y":-540,"width":340,"height":140},
		{"id":"a4","type":"text","text":"**Module 01 · Phase 4**\nPBCTS — LTLf progression → constructive trace synthesis\nBDA alignment · IDCD convergence gate · SCSL self-correction\n→ Formal Reliability Certificate v2.0 (pure Python, no SPOT)","x":240,"y":-540,"width":360,"height":140,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b1","type":"text","text":"**Module 02 · Extraction**\nPython AST → **WIR** (Workflow Intermediate Representation)\nJSON CFG — `shared_schemas/wir_schema.json`","x":-1020,"y":220,"width":360,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b2","type":"text","text":"**V3 · Structural**\nAST / dominator validation\nHARD GATE (abort=True)","x":-580,"y":60,"width":300,"height":120},
		{"id":"b3","type":"text","text":"**V2 · Symbolic**\nZ3 bounded concolic execution\n(≈ no contribution on current corpus)","x":-580,"y":440,"width":300,"height":120},
		{"id":"b5","type":"text","text":"**Confidence Certificate**\ncombined = 1 − (1−v1)(1−v2)\nV3 gates · acceptance ≥ 0.95","x":240,"y":220,"width":340,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"infra","type":"text","text":"**Infra:** docker-compose — 4 services: `spec-engine`, `extract-engine`, `equiv-engine`, `ui-engine` (internal Docker network, HTTP between services).\n**Contract:** WIR schema is the producer/consumer contract between Module 02 and Module 03. No CI configured.","x":700,"y":440,"width":820,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b4","type":"text","text":"**V1 · Dynamic**\nPEP 669 `sys.monitoring` differential tracing\nvs WIR reference interpreter\n(strict / task_only modes)","x":-430,"y":220,"width":340,"height":140},
		{"id":"c3","type":"text","text":"**Module 03 · Phase D — Model Check**\nSynchronous product vs ¬properties → emptiness\n→ **PASS / FAIL + counterexample trace**\nEQI gate: full / conservative / refuse (from M02 confidence)\n(C++ ✅ SPOT `check_compliance` / Python legacy BFS)","x":1640,"y":-180,"width":380,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d1","type":"text","text":"**Module 04 — Verification Portal**\nStreamlit UI · port 8501 (only exposed service)\ndashboard + one page per engine","x":1640,"y":220,"width":360,"height":130,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c2","type":"text","text":"**Module 03 · Phases B–C**\nDivergence-sensitive stuttering bisimulation\n(G–V refinement + spot::scc_info τ-cycle collapse)\n+ isomorphism-based behavioral clustering\n(Python ✅ / C++ ✅ — `process_wir_batch()`)","x":1040,"y":-180,"width":380,"height":200},
		{"id":"c1","type":"text","text":"**Module 03 · Phase A — Lifter**\nWIR → Labeled Transition System\nname matching: exact → edit-distance → Sentence-BERT (live in C++ via embedded pybind11)\n(Python ✅ / C++ SPOT ✅)","x":850,"y":-540,"width":380,"height":150}
	],
